Subject: [PATCH 21/22] rusticc: native AFC for COSMOS's stock Canvas

AFC, AFC_prep, AFC_hub, AFC_extruder, AFC_canvas and AFC_canvas_lane
in Rust (src/extras/afc), with the modules they pull in (functions, lane,
unit, error, spool, stats, assist, logger, respond, utils). Native only for
the Canvas sections and options (afc/scope.rs); any other AFC config, or
use_python_modules naming AFC, keeps the Python AFC. The AFC.log frame
data comes from tools/afc_codes.py (codes.rs).

Hooks used: RunoutHelper note/runout hooks, drv8833 is_active,
PyVal::json_indent, logging::format_traceback, printer.state_message,
lookup_or_load, objects_set/remove outside the plugins feature.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
